# Rustler Rampage, Spree modes "+ {1} — Untap all creatures target player controls." and "+ {1} — Target creature gains double strike until end of turn." Bot1 casts both modes
# ({W}+{1}+{1}: Moxen Pearl, Ruby, Jet) on its attacking Memnite on turn 3: it untaps (still attacking) and deals double strike damage, 2, so Bot2 goes 20 -> 18. Turn 5 it
# attacks again without the spell: 1 damage only (until end of turn), 17.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Memnite
Rustler Rampage
Plains x3
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x7
Island x13

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Memnite > Bot2)
